.TH MANTRST 1 "2026-09-28" "mantrst 0.1.0" "General Commands Manual"
.SH NAME
mantrst \- translate local manual pages with an OpenAI-compatible LLM
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
mantrst [options] page
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBmantrst\fP finds a local manual page, translates its prose through an OpenAI-compatible
LLM endpoint, and displays the result in a pager.
The original manual page is never modified.
.PP
Translated pages and individual translated paragraphs are cached.
When a page must be rebuilt, previously translated paragraphs are reused unless
\fB--refresh\fP is specified.
Uncached prose is batched to fit the local model context for llama.cpp. Gemini
uses one paragraph per request. Results remain cached per paragraph. Each
request is reported on standard error. A request that does not connect or
respond within 60 seconds fails with an error.
Gemini HTTP 429 and 503 responses are retried up to three times with an
exponential backoff.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B -s, --section SECTION
Read the manual page from SECTION.
.TP
.B --lang LANG
Set the target language. The default is \fBja-JP\fP.
.TP
.B --model MODEL
Set the model name sent to the LLM endpoint. Defaults depend on
\fB--provider\fP.
.TP
.B --provider PROVIDER
Select \fBllamacpp\fP (the default) or \fBgemini\fP. The \fBgemini\fP
provider uses Google AI Studio's OpenAI-compatible endpoint and reads
\fBGEMINI_API_KEY\fP.
.TP
.B --url URL
Set the OpenAI-compatible chat-completions endpoint.
.TP
.B --api-key API_KEY
Set the API key sent as a Bearer token to the LLM endpoint. It overrides
\fBGEMINI_API_KEY\fP when the Gemini provider is selected.
.TP
.B --refresh
Ignore both the page cache and the paragraph cache, then translate everything again.
.TP
.B --rebuild
Ignore only the page cache and rebuild the page from the paragraph cache.
This option conflicts with
\fB--refresh\fP.
.TP
.B --source
Write undecorated translated text to standard output and do not start a pager.
.TP
.B --original
Run the system man command for PAGE without translating it.
.TP
.B --theme THEME
Select terminal colors: \fBauto\fP, \fBlight\fP, or \fBdark\fP.
The default is \fBauto\fP.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B MANTRST_MODEL
Default value for
\fB--model\fP.
.TP
.B MANTRST_LLM_URL
Default value for
\fB--url\fP.
.TP
.B GEMINI_API_KEY
API key used by \fB--provider gemini\fP, unless \fB--api-key\fP is supplied.
.TP
.B MANTRST_THEME
Default value for
\fB--theme\fP.
.TP
.B COLORFGBG
When the theme is
\fBauto\fP,
this value is used to choose a light or dark color palette when available.
.TP
.B MANPAGER
Pager command used for normal terminal output. If unset,
the value of PAGER is used; otherwise the pager command less -R is used.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.cache/mantrst/
Page and paragraph translation caches.
.TP
.I ~/.config/mantrst/glossaries/
User glossary overlays. Files named
\fIcommon.toml\fP, \fIja.toml\fP, and \fIja-JP.toml\fP
are loaded in that order.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B mantrst ddcutil
Translate and display the ddcutil manual page.
.TP
.B mantrst --rebuild ddcutil
Rebuild the display from cached translated paragraphs.
.TP
.B MANTRST_THEME=dark mantrst ddcutil
Use the dark terminal theme.
.TP
.B GEMINI_API_KEY=... mantrst --provider gemini ddcutil
Translate with Google AI Studio's hosted Gemma 4 model.
.TP
.B mantrst --original ddcutil
Display the original manual page.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBman\fP(1), \fBless\fP(1)
.PP
Project source and issue tracker:
.UR https://github.com/onoue/mantrst
.UE
